Official inputs used to generate bindings (not redistributed here)
=================================================================

The generated bindings are derived from versioned Microsoft Windows API
metadata and SDK/WDK inputs, including as configured:

- Microsoft.Windows.SDK.Win32Metadata / microsoft/win32metadata
- Microsoft.Windows.WDK.Win32Metadata / microsoft/wdkmetadata
- Windows SDK WinRT contract or UnionMetadata WinMD files
- Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK component packages
- Windows SDK and WDK headers when the header provider is enabled

