redistribution policy.

Reference implementations
=========================

microsoft/windows-rs, microsoft/CsWin32, Deployment Theory's Go bindings, and
golang.org/x/sys/windows were studied and may be used as differential oracles.
Their generated bindings are not inputs and their code is not incorporated by
